    "description": "Find and analyze land on-the-go with Acres\u2019 land research app, the ultimate tool for landowners, farm managers, and land real estate professionals. Quickly check parcel property lines, owner info, and more while on location. Browse millions of US parcels with 7 filters, including soil maps, elevation, and crop history. Easily save parcels while on location and share maps from the app.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 NO ADS\r\n\r\n\u25c6 SEARCH LAND FOR SALE\r\n\r\n\u2022 Find and share land listings across the US.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 FIND OWNER NAMES AND PROPERTY LINES\r\n\r\n\u2022 Property Lines: Check property boundaries.\r\n\u2022 Owner Info: Upgrade to Acres+ to view landowner names.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 ACCESS AND SHARE LAND DATA\r\n\r\n\u2022 Save parcels so you can reference them anytime.\r\n\u2022 Easily share maps and land data from the app.\r\n\u2022 Share your location to access land data on-site.\r\n\u2022 Download offline maps and drop a pin to share your location.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 RESEARCH LAND ON THE GO\r\n\r\nSelect a parcel, view property lines, and evaluate land data, including:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Soil Maps: Soil composition and quality.\r\n\u2022 Elevation: Quickly check the range of elevation.\r\n\u2022 Vegetation Index: Plant health based on light wave reflection.\r\n\u2022 Crop History: Annual crop coverage gathered via satellite imagery.\r\n\u2022 County Rent: Estimates for cash rental rates for cropland and pastureland.\r\n\u2022 County Yield: Farmer-reported survey data of annual expected crop yields.\r\n\u2022 Property Tax: Recent property taxes where available.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 FEEDBACK AND SUPPORT\r\n\r\nRequest new features or get help from our team at: support@acres.com",
